> assistant
Here are the changes:

- Tags are now looked up from `documentUri`, so Write, Diff and Run Script no longer depend on which editor is active.
- The preview content provider now has an `onDidChange` event. Each diff refreshes the existing preview tab instead of showing stale content.
- When the target file is already open, writing applies a `WorkspaceEdit` to that document and then saves it, so unsaved edits aren't overwritten by a save after the write. An open diff updates to show no changes.
- Find-replace blocks use the open document's text as their base when the file is open.
- Shell scripts append their output to the convo document through `WorkspaceEdit`, even when it isn't focused.
- I also fixed a small bug in the shell output buffering. `prevEnd+=v` duplicated partial lines; it is now `prevEnd=v`.

I added `revealDocumentInVisibleEditorsAsync` to `util.ts` for the code block lib. `completion-provider.ts` has a private copy of the same function, but I left that file alone because it has uncommitted changes. It can be switched to the shared helper later.

